  values ('ME', 'passage', 'Question II. 1) Explain any two additional policy reforms that could be proposed to further enhance inclusive educational settings. (5 marks)', 'First, all teachers - not only special educators - should receive compulsory pre-service and in-service training in inclusive education, so that they can identify learners'' needs, use differentiated teaching and prepare individual education plans. Second, the government should fund accessible infrastructure and assistive technology (ramps, accessible toilets, hearing aids, Braille and digital materials) together with flexible assessment such as extra time or oral tests, and provide scholarships for learners from poor families. Together these reforms would let every learner participate fully.', null, '[{"point": "Reform 1 explained (e.g. mandatory teacher training in inclusive/ special needs education; individual education plans)", "marks": 2.5}, {"point": "Reform 2 explained (e.g. accessible infrastructure and assistive technology; funding/ scholarships for disadvantaged; flexible curriculum and assessment; mother-tongue/ bilingual support)", "marks": 2.5}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'english-language'),
